## Performance Requirements

- Startup time: < 200ms with 10,000 connections (SQLite backend)
- Filter/search response: < 16ms (one frame at 60fps)
- Theme switch: instant (no re-render delay)
- Health check: concurrent, max 100 parallel TCP dials
- Config save: < 100ms for YAML, < 50ms for SQLite

## Testing Strategy

- Unit tests for all new packages (mode, motion, theme, store, import, export, vault, hooks, audit)
- Table-driven tests for motion engine (count+operator+motion combinations)
- Integration tests for store backends (YAML ↔ SQLite parity)
- Snapshot tests for theme rendering (golden files)
- Benchmark tests for search/filter with 10,000 connections
